        ("people-workforce-plan", "Workforce Plan", "Forecast workforce capacity and skills against business demand and approved scenarios.", "Model role demand, attrition assumptions, hiring lead time, internal mobility, skills, and cost. Use aggregate data, document uncertainty, and consider reskilling or process alternatives before headcount conclusions."),
        ("people-engagement", "Engagement Survey Analysis", "Analyze employee feedback responsibly while protecting confidentiality and avoiding false precision.", "Check response counts and anonymity thresholds, compare valid cohorts, code comments with a transparent scheme, and report themes with caveats. Avoid deanonymizing small groups or asserting causes from survey correlations."),
        ("people-policy", "HR Policy Draft Review", "Review an HR policy draft for clarity, internal consistency, accessibility, and escalation needs.", "Check purpose, scope, definitions, responsibilities, process, exceptions, records, and cross-references. Flag employment-law and jurisdiction questions for qualified counsel; never label the policy legally compliant without review."),
        ("people-offboarding", "Employee Offboarding Checklist", "Coordinate a respectful offboarding with access, knowledge transfer, property, records, and final responsibilities.", "Follow approved timelines and policy, coordinate least-privilege access removal, preserve required records, transfer business knowledge, and communicate respectfully. Protect confidentiality and route disputes or legal holds to HR and counsel."),
