        ("customer-service-recovery", "Service Recovery Plan", "Restore trust after a service failure through verified facts, ownership, and follow-through.", "Confirm impact and affected commitments, coordinate approved remedy, communicate with empathy and accuracy, and track completion. Do not admit legal liability or offer compensation outside authority."),
        ("customer-success-qbr", "Customer Business Review", "Prepare a customer review that connects usage, outcomes, open risks, and next-period goals.", "Use agreed success criteria and validated data, show progress and limits, include customer voice and unresolved issues, and align a small set of next actions with owners and dates."),
