        ("legal-obligation-map", "Obligation Tracker", "Turn contract or policy text into traceable obligations, owners, dates, and evidence.", "Capture exact source clause, obligation, trigger, owner, due date, evidence, dependencies, and uncertainty. Preserve original wording where interpretation matters and route unclear duties to counsel."),
        ("legal-policy-gap", "Compliance Gap Assessment", "Compare supplied controls or evidence against a named policy or framework requirement.", "Use the exact provided version and requirement IDs, link each conclusion to evidence, and label not assessed versus unmet. Do not claim certification, legal compliance, or audit assurance from a desk review."),
        ("legal-privacy-intake", "Privacy Review Intake", "Structure a privacy review by mapping purpose, data, access, retention, and user impact.", "Trace data source, purpose, categories, recipients, access, storage, retention, deletion, and user rights. Minimize personal data and route legal bases and jurisdiction conclusions to qualified privacy counsel."),
